# The exposed declarations that carry no comment — the pin `scripts/doc-check.sh` §2 holds
# `zerg doc --check` to, one name per line, spelled the way a reader types it back in.
#
# IT IS A LIST AND NOT A COUNT, and that is the whole point of the file. The pin here used to
# be `UNDOCUMENTED=18`, an equality on a total, and an equality on a total is met by two
# errors cancelling: write the comment for one declaration and add a bare `pub` elsewhere in
# the same change, and 18 is still 18 while the set underneath has moved twice.
#
# IT IS EMPTY. Every `pub` name the standard library exposes carries a comment. A line added
# here is a declaration somebody shipped without one, and the gate names it until the comment
# is written or the line is added on purpose.
